---
const steps = [
  {
    num: '01',
    title: 'Create a space',
    cmd: 'grove new',
    desc: 'Scaffold a Grove project with the CLI (interactive).',
  },
  {
    num: '02',
    title: 'Add records',
    cmd: 'grove import',
    desc: 'Turn a Markdown list (or hand-write YAML) into records/*.yml.',
  },
  {
    num: '03',
    title: 'Build the site',
    cmd: 'grove generate',
    desc: 'Build data, then run your framework build (astro build today).',
  },
  {
    num: '04',
    title: 'Deploy',
    cmd: '--deploy <provider>',
    desc: 'Pick vercel / netlify / cloudflare / github-pages at scaffold time.',
  },
]
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20" aria-labelledby="get-started-title">
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-subtle">
    Get started in seconds
  </p>
  <h2
    id="get-started-title"
    class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-balance text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl"
  >
    Create, run, and publish a Grove space.
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <ol class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      {
        steps.map((step, i) => (
          <li
            class={`flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border p-5 transition-colors ${
              i === 0
                ? 'border-border-strong bg-card'
                : 'border-border bg-surface hover:bg-card'
            }`}
          >
            <span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border-strong bg-bg font-mono text-xs text-muted">
              {step.num}
            </span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">{step.title}</h3>
                <code class="font-mono text-xs text-subtle">{step.cmd}</code>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{step.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div
      class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border-strong bg-[#0a0b0c]"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4 py-3">
        <span class="size-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
        <span class="size-3 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
        <span class="size-3 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]"></span>
        <span class="ml-3 font-mono text-xs text-subtle">grove — create a space</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="overflow-x-auto p-5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-subtle">$</span> <span class="text-fg">pnpm dlx @grove-dev/cli@latest new my-space</span>

<span class="text-muted">? Where should the new space live?</span> <span class="text-fg">my-space</span>
<span class="text-muted">? Pick a blueprint</span> <span class="text-fg">project-directory</span>
<span class="text-muted">? Pick a framework (V1: astro only)</span> <span class="text-fg">astro</span>
<span class="text-muted">? Where will this space be deployed?</span> <span class="text-fg">github-pages</span>

<span class="text-muted">Creating project structure...</span>

<span class="text-accent-green">✓ Copied 47 files into my-space</span>
<span class="text-accent-green">✓ Wrote grove.config.ts</span>
<span class="text-accent-green">✓ Pinned @grove-dev/{astro,cli,core}@0.2.20</span>

<span class="text-muted">Next steps:</span>
  <span class="text-subtle">cd my-space</span>
  <span class="text-subtle">pnpm install</span>
  <span class="text-subtle">pnpm exec grove validate</span>
  <span class="text-subtle">pnpm build</span></code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
